    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.Frand(Magnitude: number): number`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`float llFrand(float Magnitude);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a float that is pseudo random in the range [0.0, <b>mag</b>) or (<b>mag</b>, 0.0].[[1]](#footnote_1)</p>
  <p>This means that the returned value can be any value in the range 0.0 to <b>mag</b> including 0.0, but not including the value of <b>mag</b> itself. The sign of <b>mag</b> matches the return.</p>
</p>
